		<RichText x="63" y="369" fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W04" fontSize="80" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#ffffff" width="509" height="81" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W04" fontSize="80" color="#ffffff">苍遒的木灵长</p>
			</content>
			<filters>
				<DropShadowFilter angle="40" color="#ffe599" distance="16" alpha="0.75" quality="2" blurX="25" blurY="25"/>
			</filters>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="66" y="1068" width="422" height="39" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">虬须：<span color="#ffdfbf">34%生命值</span><span>护罩，击中树心即可立即破坏，中断扎根，期间</span><span color="#ffdfbf">火抗-200%</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="255" width="399" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">树妖从地里面扣出一块晶髓，扔向玩家，造成<span color="#ffe599">100%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="479" width="438" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">树妖突然跃起，并重重击地，造成<span color="#b8b8b8">100%</span><span>伤害。持有「灵髓」时攻击造成</span><span color="#ffe599">岩元素</span><span>伤害，且伤害倍率提升，造成</span><span color="#ffe599">125%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="703" width="431" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">树妖进行3段普通攻击，依次造成<span color="#b8b8b8">50%,<br/>50%,70%</span><span>伤害。持有「灵髓」时攻击造成</span><span color="#ffe599">岩元素</span><span>伤害，且伤害倍率提升，依次造成</span><span color="#ffe599">75%,75%,100%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
