		<RichText x="738" y="927" width="424" height="229" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">树妖进行「扎根」，下肢生出<span textDecoration="underline">虬须</span><span>，暴露胸部树心，持续</span><span color="#ffdfbf">10s</span><span>后恢复</span><span color="#ffdfbf">34%生命值</span><span>，同时获得持续</span><span color="#ffdfbf">30s</span><span>的「灵髓」。受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响后，树妖便会跌倒在地，同时树心高度也将下降。<br/>破坏虬须时，若树妖附着了</span><span color="#ff9999">火元素</span><span>，那么它将受到</span><span color="#ffdfbf">34%生命值</span><span>的</span><span color="#ff9999">火元素真伤</span><span>，无附着。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
